(7600096, 1227908, 67258, '<td valign="top">Either someone has been incredibly busy, or was able to go to an Addams Family stage play.  Either way, good entry.</td>', 'Either someone has been incredibly busy, or was able to go to an Addams Family stage play.  Either way, good entry.', '2018-11-02 05:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
