(7601783, 1227908, 70661, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you sneak your camera in to get this shot (usually production plays don''t allow it)?  ... and Hooray to Sony!  :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks! It''s just a small local theater. As long as there wasn''t a flash it was allowed.  :)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Did you sneak your camera in to get this shot (usually production plays don''t allow it)?  ... and Hooray to Sony!  :-)   Thanks! It''s just a small local theater. As long as there wasn''t a flash it was allowed.  :)', '2018-11-09 12:50:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7601784, 1227902, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is still not "fishing" really ... looks more like scavenging, or being opportunistic as the fish is clearly high and dry in the mud.  Still a very interesting capture and sheds some light on the habits of Grackles perhaps not documented before.  Heck - you could be famous!  :-)</td>', 'This is still not "fishing" really ... looks more like scavenging, or being opportunistic as the fish is clearly high and dry in the mud.  Still a very interesting capture and sheds some light on the habits of Grackles perhaps not documented before.  Heck - you could be famous!  :-)', '2018-11-09 12:51:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7601865, 1228050, 97225, '<td valign="top">What an awe/some/ful character! Congrats on the ribbon and thanks for the notes.</td>', 'What an awe/some/ful character! Congrats on the ribbon and thanks for the notes.', '2018-11-09 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
